  "steps": [
    "Syrup: boil the sugar, orange juice, water, zest and cinnamon for 5–7 minutes, then cool.",
    "Fold the filo, cut into strips and let them dry for 1–2 hours, or dry them in the oven at 150 °C for 10–15 minutes without browning.",
    "Whisk the eggs and sugar until pale and fluffy, then add the yogurt, butter, vanilla, orange zest, baking powder and salt.",
    "Crumble the dried filo in (pieces, not powder) and wait 5–10 minutes for it to hydrate. The batter should be thick; add filo if too wet or a splash of orange juice if too dry.",
    "Pour into a greased tin and bake at 180 °C for 45–50 minutes until golden.",
    "Pour the syrup over the cake (hot syrup on hot cake, or cold syrup on warm cake) and let it soak in. Brush with a little fresh orange juice before serving."
  ]
